# for this seat; counters are frozen; this is a recommendation for the lane owner).
#
# Make rev-list --parents parsing keep ALL parents so origins() birth detection
# matches the frozen v5 definition ("a commit whose blob of the file holds key k
# while no parent of it holds k" - tools/append-only-audit.py docstring line 15)
# and the counter's implementation (tools/round50-append-audit-v5-check.py:418,
# 445-452). Event diffing stays first-parent (numstat/deleted_lines unchanged).
# The parsing predates v5, but only v5's birth semantics depend on it: v4 origin
# was "first blob in rev-list order", which never read `parents`.
#
# After this diff, the merge fixture in merge_fixture.sh must report
# graded=21 ungraded=0 for BOTH merge-parent orders, and
# round50-append-audit-v5-check.py on that fixture must stop reporting
# "ungraded 1 > v5 natively exempt 0".
